== Effects ==
* Teleports Isaac into the {{r|Boss Room}}.

== Notes ==
* Using '''IV - The Emperor''' on a floor that doesn't have a {{r|Boss Room}} will teleport Isaac to a random room.
* Using '''IV - The Emperor''' in {{s|The Void}} will always teleport you to a random unexplored boss room in priority.
* On a {{curse|labyrinth}} floor, '''IV - The Emperor''' will usually teleport Isaac to the second boss room; however, it is possible to be teleported to the first one instead.
* When {{curse|Maze}} is active, using this card can teleport Isaac to a random room instead.
* '''IV - The Emperor''' cannot appear in [[greed mode]].

== Strategy ==
* Once the boss is defeated, or when one is ready to face the boss, '''IV - The Emperor''' can be used to escape dangerous rooms like {{r|Curse Room}}s and {{r|Challenge Room}}s.

== Synergies ==
* {{I|Tarot Cloth|r}}: If the boss has not yet been defeated, grants a {{e|Soul Heart}} on top of teleporting Isaac.
** {{I|Tarot Cloth|r}} + {{i|Blank Card}} + {{i|Car Battery|n}} : Grants 2 soul hearts.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|Sol}}: Using this card to defeat the boss earlier can allow more utilization of Sol’s stat boost, curse removal, and mapping, for the remainder of the [[floor]].
* {{I|Tarot Cloth|nr}}: No effect.

== Trivia ==
* [[wikipedia:The Emperor (tarot card)|The Emperor]] is the fourth card of a Major Arcana set.

